# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# StockFilter configuration
#
# The app runs with NONE of these set: SEC EDGAR needs no key, so fundamentals,
# scores, filings and the screener all work out of the box. The keys below add
# price charts and news, and are all free.
#
# Copy to .env.local and fill in what you want.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Database (required for the screener and precomputed scores) ------------
# Provision Postgres on Railway (railway.com -> New -> Database -> PostgreSQL)
# and paste its connection string here.
DATABASE_URL=

# --- SEC EDGAR (no key, but identify yourself) ------------------------------
# The SEC requires a User-Agent with a contact address and blocks requests
# without one. Put your own email here.
SEC_USER_AGENT="StockFilter (your-name) your-email@example.com"

# --- Alpaca: price charts (free) --------------------------------------------
# Sign up at alpaca.markets, open a PAPER trading account (available worldwide),
# then Dashboard -> API Keys -> Generate. The free Basic plan gives 7+ years of
# minute bars at 200 requests/minute.
# Without these, everything works except the price charts.
ALPACA_API_KEY_ID=
ALPACA_API_SECRET_KEY=
# "iex" on the free plan. Set to "sip" only if you pay for consolidated data.
ALPACA_FEED=iex

# --- Finnhub: news, logos, peers (free) -------------------------------------
# Free key at finnhub.io/register — 60 requests/minute.
# Note: Finnhub's free tier does NOT include price candles (it returns 403),
# which is why Alpaca supplies chart data.
FINNHUB_API_KEY=

# --- EODHD: worldwide coverage (paid, optional) -----------------------------
# Setting this ONE key switches the entire app from the free US/Canada stack to
# worldwide coverage: 60+ exchanges, 150,000+ tickers, global fundamentals.
# No other change is needed.
#
# ALL-IN-ONE is ~$100/mo (eodhd.com/pricing). Be aware that its true real-time
# feed covers US equities, forex and crypto only; other world exchanges are
# 15-20 minutes delayed because of per-exchange licensing.
EODHD_API_KEY=

# --- Vercel cron protection --------------------------------------------------
# Any random string. Vercel sends it as a Bearer token on scheduled requests so
# the refresh endpoint cannot be triggered by anyone else.
CRON_SECRET=
